[{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a098a6128f93d9e6d75874cd11c4d3d_35265.mp3","author":"李煜","author_id":0,"dynasty":"五代","id":"71075","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"一重山，两重山。山远天高烟水寒，相思枫叶丹。\n菊花开，菊花残。塞雁高飞人未还，一帘风月闲。","playing":false,"sound_duration":35265,"name":"长相思·一重山"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a035304708c7db41a31de3821749b11_57024.mp3","author":"李煜","author_id":0,"dynasty":"五代","id":"70838","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c5e410b419f52dcaf5a36a42c11_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"春花秋月何时了？往事知多少。小楼昨夜又东风，故国不堪回首月明中。\n雕栏玉砌应犹在，只是朱颜改。问君能有几多愁？恰似一江春水向东流。","playing":false,"sound_duration":57024,"name":"虞美人·春花秋月何时了","video_id":"30"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0a5d15e670e57d48930d08d87b5369_40248.mp3","author":"李煜","author_id":0,"dynasty":"五代","id":"47040","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c656c999ea9d8a5d7cf953a499d_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"林花谢了春红，太匆匆。无奈朝来寒雨晚来风。\n胭脂泪，相留醉，几时重。自是人生长恨水长东。(相留一作：留人)","playing":false,"sound_duration":40248,"name":"相见欢·林花谢了春红","video_id":"28"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a09aed3c0b310930c2b4e1f76cc501d_36649.mp3","author":"李煜","author_id":0,"dynasty":"五代","id":"71074","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c7efc05462d8bd6b3ac90facaeb_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"无言独上西楼，月如钩。寂寞梧桐深院锁清秋。\n剪不断，理还乱，是离愁。别是一般滋味在心头。(一般一作：一番)","playing":false,"sound_duration":36649,"name":"相见欢·无言独上西楼"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0aa61b324575e108029f008d63016c_23232.mp3","author":"李煜","author_id":0,"dynasty":"五代","id":"71492","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c644cd560c3d8acdecaf6ece31a_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"浪花有意千里雪，桃花无言一队春。一壶酒，一竿身，快活如侬有几人。","playing":false,"sound_duration":23232,"name":"渔父·浪花有意千里雪"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0a81cd68c4a4e369d9bd4ac4f8277a_53832.mp3","author":"李煜","author_id":0,"dynasty":"五代","id":"71076","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c6ac8b30069e5a672920a528302_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"帘外雨潺潺，春意阑珊。罗衾不耐五更寒。梦里不知身是客，一晌贪欢。\n独自莫凭栏，无限江山。别时容易见时难。流水落花春去也，天上人间。","playing":false,"sound_duration":53832,"name":"浪淘沙令·帘外雨潺潺"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03cea397799006a19b7096280bd493_19824.mp3","author":"孟浩然","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"7494","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07cf90d5757fdd013a40e46b1c5f24_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"春眠不觉晓，处处闻啼鸟。\n夜来风雨声，花落知多少。","playing":false,"sound_duration":19824,"name":"春晓"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a04da64b1556c166c7cf7d525c7cee2_28212.mp3","author":"王应麟","author_id":0,"dynasty":"宋代","id":"1013711","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"人之初，性本善。\n性相近，习相远。\n苟不教，性乃迁。\n教之道，贵以专。\n子不学，非所宜。\n幼不学，老何为。\n玉不琢，不成器。\n人不学，不知义。","playing":false,"sound_duration":28212,"name":"人之初"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03cea52db313b8527e31d788280b4b_22920.mp3","author":"唐寅","author_id":0,"dynasty":"明代","id":"71962","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07cf91f7d8831db1df7a91e25e6d3d_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"头上红冠不用裁，满身雪白走将来。(裁一作：戴)\n平生不敢轻言语，一叫千门万户开。","playing":false,"sound_duration":22920,"name":"画鸡"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0aa979fbbeda0b4d050574e8ecb817_17376.mp3","author":"白居易","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"71298","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"小娃撑小艇，偷采白莲回。\n不解藏踪迹，浮萍一道开。","playing":false,"sound_duration":17376,"name":"池上"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037ad8912e76a0138db7a618de1b95_25536.mp3","author":"杨万里","author_id":0,"dynasty":"宋代","id":"70970","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0386762117d91556143f938dc9d80a_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"泉眼无声惜细流，树阴照水爱晴柔。\n小荷才露尖尖角，早有蜻蜓立上头。","playing":false,"sound_duration":25536,"name":"小池","video_id":"1"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03cea43768d37fcb1f62b6a8c62fa4_24336.mp3","author":"贾岛","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"31653","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07cf9196afc2ce4438da7290e62a8f_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"松下问童子，言师采药去。\n只在此山中，云深不知处。","playing":false,"sound_duration":24336,"name":"寻隐者不遇"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a04b689172d60cb6be69f9056bfe257_22536.mp3","author":"李白","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"8014","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"李白乘舟将欲行，忽闻岸上踏歌声。\n桃花潭水深千尺，不及汪伦送我情。","playing":false,"sound_duration":22536,"name":"赠汪伦"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037ad6ddbeace56fcd9b2324385502_28248.mp3","author":"李白","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"7816","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03867525f681764581a799e37180d8_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"床前明月光，疑是地上霜。\n举头望明月，低头思故乡。","playing":false,"sound_duration":28248,"name":"静夜思"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0454f2cd2dfb77fea04db3a97534a5_19200.mp3","author":"李峤","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"3493","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a087494ce7135620800d37beac301b5_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"解落三秋叶，能开二月花。\n过江千尺浪，入竹万竿斜。","playing":false,"sound_duration":19200,"name":"风"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0a34c1286933067d8e0e029b80e464_19271.mp3","author":"李白","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"1013632","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"小时不识月，呼作白玉盘。\n又疑瑶台镜，飞在青云端。","playing":false,"sound_duration":19271,"name":"古朗月行(节选)"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037ad5753ec7c79e65724cf7010387_24096.mp3","author":"李绅","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"338772","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0386749a4e5e9411e3780f40aadb50_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"锄禾日当午，汗滴禾下土。\n谁知盘中餐，粒粒皆辛苦？","playing":false,"sound_duration":24096,"name":"悯农二首·其二"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03cea2d64415595b194cca8a563c35_20400.mp3","author":"王维","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"71047","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07cf90589e2dfdcb5562815cc12e70_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"远看山有色，近听水无声。\n春去花还在，人来鸟不惊。","playing":false,"sound_duration":20400,"name":"画"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03cea1a84c3d1fed453540f9d00ee1_29184.mp3","author":"汉乐府","author_id":0,"dynasty":"两汉","id":"70885","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07aa5011670115ce03e905b06400e8_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"江南可采莲，莲叶何田田。鱼戏莲叶间。\n鱼戏莲叶东，鱼戏莲叶西，鱼戏莲叶南，鱼戏莲叶北。","playing":false,"sound_duration":29184,"name":"江南"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0454f1102d5cbea414664db9447099_25872.mp3","author":"骆宾王","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"4017","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a087493d6853f8cbf9ffc5e55fbd1b0_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"鹅，鹅，鹅，曲项向天歌。\n白毛浮绿水，红掌拨清波。","playing":false,"sound_duration":25872,"name":"咏鹅"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a04fd48105db415077370ea5f302475_20741.mp3","author":"佚名","author_id":0,"dynasty":"宋代","id":"73422","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"群儿戏于庭，一儿登瓮，足跌没水中，众皆弃去。光持石击瓮破之，水迸，儿得活。","playing":false,"sound_duration":20741,"name":"司马光砸缸"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0454fadc993d8f673240785f711a6a_27792.mp3","author":"王昌龄","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"71218","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"荷叶罗裙一色裁，芙蓉向脸两边开。\n乱入池中看不见，闻歌始觉有人来。","playing":false,"sound_duration":27792,"name":"采莲曲"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0454f8cba08ab68b41b7b0cbea3d5e_24840.mp3","author":"叶绍翁","author_id":0,"dynasty":"宋代","id":"71195","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"萧萧梧叶送寒声，江上秋风动客情。\n知有儿童挑促织，夜深篱落一灯明。","playing":false,"sound_duration":24840,"name":"夜书所见"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037adffc279bc0779927f1a4669ffc_18047.mp3","author":"袁枚","author_id":0,"dynasty":"清代","id":"71038","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03867a0ad7d34fa9901042845c98e7_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"牧童骑黄牛，歌声振林樾。\n意欲捕鸣蝉，忽然闭口立。","playing":false,"sound_duration":18047,"name":"所见"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0454f808526c084bc422b67baf0d2f_20688.mp3","author":"苏轼","author_id":0,"dynasty":"宋代","id":"70939","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a087496e624bc104f5606d30697a9c0_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"荷尽已无擎雨盖，菊残犹有傲霜枝。\n一年好景君须记，最是橙黄橘绿时。(最是一作：正是)","playing":false,"sound_duration":20688,"name":"赠刘景文"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0454f99178598783cb696a9851d37b_22776.mp3","author":"苏轼","author_id":0,"dynasty":"宋代","id":"70938","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c830d1752d3a1c664e5f2fdcc4b_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"水光潋滟晴方好，山色空蒙雨亦奇。\n欲把西湖比西子，淡妆浓抹总相宜。","playing":false,"sound_duration":22776,"name":"饮湖上初晴后雨"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037ae0e287ad8928dbcfc68fea0c9b_19608.mp3","author":"杜牧","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"27824","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03867a6f04a713448de48dda887bd8_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"远上寒山石径斜，白云生处有人家。(生处一作：深处)\n停车坐爱枫林晚，霜叶红于二月花。","playing":false,"sound_duration":19608,"name":"山行"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0454f9fd38f3f2746ef43e8b8c12fc_22776.mp3","author":"刘禹锡","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"19085","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"湖光秋月两相和，潭面无风镜未磨。\n遥望洞庭山水翠，白银盘里一青螺。(山水翠一作：山水色)","playing":false,"sound_duration":22776,"name":"望洞庭"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0454fa56837d72c500b6b8f410fbba_20376.mp3","author":"李白","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"8345","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"朝辞白帝彩云间，千里江陵一日还。\n两岸猿声啼不住，轻舟已过万重山。","playing":false,"sound_duration":20376,"name":"早发白帝城"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037ae18bb6f0a63b0b3e8462bab653_19800.mp3","author":"李白","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"8328","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03867ab60345055cf5e019223bc3c9_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"天门中断楚江开，碧水东流至此回。\n两岸青山相对出，孤帆一片日边来。","playing":false,"sound_duration":19800,"name":"望天门山"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a04bbe53b4cd62256397c896db574d9_159555.mp3","author":"","author_id":0,"dynasty":"南北朝","id":"71131","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"唧唧复唧唧，木兰当户织。不闻机杼声，唯闻女叹息。(唯一作：惟)\n\n问女何所思，问女何所忆。女亦无所思，女亦无所忆。昨夜见军帖，可汗大点兵，军书十二卷，卷卷有爷名。阿爷无大儿，木兰无长兄，愿为市鞍马，从此替爷征。\n\n东市买骏马，西市买鞍鞯，南市买辔头，北市买长鞭。旦辞爷娘去，暮宿黄河边，不闻爷娘唤女声，但闻黄河流水鸣溅溅。旦辞黄河去，暮至黑山头，不闻爷娘唤女声，但闻燕山胡骑鸣啾啾。\n\n万里赴戎机，关山度若飞。朔气传金柝，寒光照铁衣。将军百战死，壮士十年归。\n\n归来见天子，天子坐明堂。策勋十二转，赏赐百千强。可汗问所欲，木兰不用尚书郎，愿驰千里足，送儿还故乡。\n\n爷娘闻女来，出郭相扶将；阿姊闻妹来，当户理红妆；小弟闻姊来，磨刀霍霍向猪羊。开我东阁门，坐我西阁床。脱我战时袍，著我旧时裳。当窗理云鬓，对镜帖花黄。出门看火伴，火伴皆惊忙：同行十二年，不知木兰是女郎。\n\n雄兔脚扑朔，雌兔眼迷离；双兔傍地走，安能辨我是雄雌？","playing":false,"sound_duration":159555,"name":"木兰诗"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0376c8e8589f2dcf379666e820243b_32904.mp3","author":"龚自珍","author_id":0,"dynasty":"清代","id":"71045","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a038663d3dea99dbd05d752d3d214e4_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"浩荡离愁白日斜，吟鞭东指即天涯。\n落红不是无情物，化作春泥更护花。","playing":false,"sound_duration":32904,"name":"己亥杂诗·其五"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0376cb2f9f3be6e3760a83d800b8ff_24648.mp3","author":"赵师秀","author_id":0,"dynasty":"宋代","id":"69146","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07540cec5737deff5d802fbeac9269_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"黄梅时节家家雨，青草池塘处处蛙。\n有约不来过夜半，闲敲棋子落灯花。","playing":false,"sound_duration":24648,"name":"约客"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0376c87ae36654162e346984f4706a_45384.mp3","author":"陆游","author_id":0,"dynasty":"宋代","id":"69127","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07540ca769691f06e5633be751fa22_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"莫笑农家腊酒浑，丰年留客足鸡豚。\n山重水复疑无路，柳暗花明又一村。\n箫鼓追随春社近，衣冠简朴古风存。\n从今若许闲乘月，拄杖无时夜叩门。","playing":false,"sound_duration":45384,"name":"游山西村"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a057fa5bf9309ab8deeecef3df5eb07_20303.mp3","author":"王安石","author_id":0,"dynasty":"宋代","id":"69088","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"飞来山上千寻塔，闻说鸡鸣见日升。(飞来山一作：飞来峰)\n不畏浮云遮望眼，自缘身在最高层。","playing":false,"sound_duration":20303,"name":"登飞来峰"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0376ca1adcbeb5a781a77625ed0295_32904.mp3","author":"李商隐","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"28931","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07540cc19f0369c2736e435aea3c6e_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"宣室求贤访逐臣，贾生才调更无伦。\n可怜夜半虚前席，不问苍生问鬼神。","playing":false,"sound_duration":32904,"name":"贾生"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0376c9c343def3b5fae1aedc396c65_32904.mp3","author":"杜牧","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"27713","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a038664292c27d6be545f922859863b_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"烟笼寒水月笼沙，夜泊秦淮近酒家。\n商女不知亡国恨，隔江犹唱后庭花。","playing":false,"sound_duration":32904,"name":"泊秦淮"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0376c66f42ee16f658fa73b2439305_28848.mp3","author":"韩愈","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"17883","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0752736ff5d314daaeef86d4a92ecf_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"草树知春不久归，百般红紫斗芳菲。(草树一作：草木)\n杨花榆荚无才思，惟解漫天作雪飞。","playing":false,"sound_duration":28848,"name":"晚春"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0376c801db11c7dc4f57c7b0126fe3_39888.mp3","author":"杜甫","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"10374","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0386637ea471a7dd4d10c159760c24_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"岱宗夫如何？齐鲁青未了。\n造化钟神秀，阴阳割昏晓。\n荡胸生曾云，决眦入归鸟。(曾同：层)\n会当凌绝顶，一览众山小。","playing":false,"sound_duration":39888,"name":"望岳"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0376c5bee664679ecaaea9dc4b7e3f_32808.mp3","author":"岑参","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"9747","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0386632f6b91ad38616d2fde0314d4_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"故园东望路漫漫，双袖龙钟泪不干。\n马上相逢无纸笔，凭君传语报平安。","playing":false,"sound_duration":32808,"name":"逢入京使"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0376c5597f6ee5830fcf96917872b3_26472.mp3","author":"李白","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"8481","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07527335a1db7b323088e702ee297c_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"谁家玉笛暗飞声，散入春风满洛城。\n此夜曲中闻折柳，何人不起故园情。","playing":false,"sound_duration":26472,"name":"春夜洛城闻笛"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0376c4f6f517b9021e1ef58b997c16_26352.mp3","author":"王维","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"5749","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a038662adcce536d268f46e881b9eb5_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"独坐幽篁里，弹琴复长啸。\n深林人不知，明月来相照。","playing":false,"sound_duration":26352,"name":"竹里馆"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0376c7790f6536d49340c36eab110d_27288.mp3","author":"陈子昂","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"4156","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a075273ba53999fcba53f2e0c36e7d1_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"前不见古人，后不见来者。\n念天地之悠悠，独怆然而涕下！","playing":false,"sound_duration":27288,"name":"登幽州台歌"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037adc912c02869c7928b6070b0abf_22584.mp3","author":"贺知章","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"5122","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0386791cd3eee89fe8922b521b9bd9_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"碧玉妆成一树高，万条垂下绿丝绦。\n不知细叶谁裁出，二月春风似剪刀。","playing":false,"sound_duration":22584,"name":"咏柳"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a063346bb52384b484f09e1a6c1bf27_17084.mp3","author":"李绅","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"1013633","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"春种一粒粟，秋收万颗子。\n四海无闲田，农夫犹饿死。","playing":false,"sound_duration":17084,"name":"悯农二首·其一"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037ade5e5259875d91225c9fa10a80_21504.mp3","author":"杜甫","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"71194","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a038679c42b68606575a66ffb7bc125_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"两个黄鹂鸣翠柳，一行白鹭上青天。\n窗含西岭千秋雪，门泊东吴万里船。","playing":false,"sound_duration":21504,"name":"绝句"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037adbaf19eaa6cea3196cf74d8459_21312.mp3","author":"高鼎","author_id":0,"dynasty":"清代","id":"71046","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a038678ca3807964d3c5fea035cc3aa_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"草长莺飞二月天，拂堤杨柳醉春烟。\n儿童散学归来早，忙趁东风放纸鸢。","playing":false,"sound_duration":21312,"name":"村居"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a04975767da591ab25e4459a0db5ac3_16953.mp3","author":"查慎行","author_id":0,"dynasty":"清代","id":"71027","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a08d58574efd7609da9eced46dc9053_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"月黑见渔灯，孤光一点萤。\n微微风簇浪，散作满河星。","playing":false,"sound_duration":16953,"name":"舟夜书所见"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037add7dca92edc7887e059d90f67b_24456.mp3","author":"杨万里","author_id":0,"dynasty":"宋代","id":"70971","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a038679878e8b61a6f680773c5866e6_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"毕竟西湖六月中，风光不与四时同。\n接天莲叶无穷碧，映日荷花别样红。","playing":false,"sound_duration":24456,"name":"晓出净慈寺送林子方"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a06e26864ab8c89124ce1df53876258_25495.mp3","author":"白居易","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"21818","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"离离原上草，一岁一枯荣。\n野火烧不尽，春风吹又生。\n远芳侵古道，晴翠接荒城。\n又送王孙去，萋萋满别情。","playing":false,"sound_duration":25495,"name":"赋得古原草送别"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037ad92eac3c0c676d94cfb82df721_24264.mp3","author":"王之涣","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"13034","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a038677ae18db01c6dbce8c507b44c6_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"白日依山尽，黄河入海流。\n欲穷千里目，更上一层楼。","playing":false,"sound_duration":24264,"name":"登鹳雀楼"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a06575a5b705fa7ac5529f0e2c5f87c_26357.mp3","author":"曹雪芹","author_id":0,"dynasty":"清代","id":"71770","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"杏帘招客饮，在望有山庄。\n菱荇鹅儿水，桑榆燕子梁。\n一畦春韭绿，十里稻花香。\n盛世无饥馁，何须耕织忙。","playing":false,"sound_duration":26357,"name":"菱荇鹅儿水"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03cea5e02193925cf2a57364a0277c_19584.mp3","author":"李白","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"71217","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07cf92e293bd44e4babafd55a17417_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"危楼高百尺，手可摘星辰。\n不敢高声语，恐惊天上人。","playing":false,"sound_duration":19584,"name":"夜宿山寺"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037ad9c210a51c1a3ed8f5a20ba5b5_24168.mp3","author":"李白","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"71193","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a038677f26a20fa30573638d8c130bf_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"日照香炉生紫烟，遥看瀑布挂前川。\n飞流直下三千尺，疑是银河落九天。","playing":false,"sound_duration":24168,"name":"望庐山瀑布"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0454f383b80af0a22be764931f6db4_17424.mp3","author":"王安石","author_id":0,"dynasty":"宋代","id":"70927","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0454f3a1915b05691a6f7c68b85052_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"墙角数枝梅，凌寒独自开。\n遥知不是雪，为有暗香来。","playing":false,"sound_duration":17424,"name":"梅花"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0454f51997f0da83aa32cd58e0df3b_23328.mp3","author":"佚名","author_id":0,"dynasty":"南北朝","id":"48041","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a087496804845d0ea64d4d985c1cb06_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"敕勒川，阴山下。天似穹庐，笼盖四野。天苍苍，野茫茫。风吹草低见牛羊。","playing":false,"sound_duration":23328,"name":"敕勒歌"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0454f4332b5f31ff9df3b0612a3dfb_24143.mp3","author":"胡令能","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"40035","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0874957d953572e7a66c605237f51e_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"蓬头稚子学垂纶，侧坐莓苔草映身。\n路人借问遥招手，怕得鱼惊不应人。","playing":false,"sound_duration":24143,"name":"小儿垂钓"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037ada538ef1f8ab39e5954325e03b_19344.mp3","author":"柳宗元","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"18302","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03867885715ce2c9dba3c003acf342_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"千山鸟飞绝，万径人踪灭。\n孤舟蓑笠翁，独钓寒江雪。","playing":false,"sound_duration":19344,"name":"江雪"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a09d1470870cb393b904e8c159d2aae_269880.mp3","author":"李清照","author_id":0,"dynasty":"宋代","id":"132515","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"绍兴癸丑五月，枢密韩公、工部尚书胡公使虏，通两宫也。有易安室者，父祖皆出韩公门下，今家世沦替，子姓寒微，不敢望公之车尘。又贫病，但神明未衰落。见此大号令，不能忘言，作古、律诗各一章，以寄区区之意，以待采诗者云。\n三年夏六月，天子视朝久。\n凝旒望南云，垂衣思北狩。\n如闻帝若曰，岳牧与群后。\n贤宁无半千，运已遇阳九。\n勿勒燕然铭，勿种金城柳。\n岂无纯孝臣，识此霜露悲。\n何必羹舍肉，便可车载脂。\n土地非所惜，玉帛如尘泥。\n谁当可将命，币厚辞益卑。\n四岳佥曰俞，臣下帝所知。\n中朝第一人，春官有昌黎。\n身为百夫特，行足万人师。\n嘉祐与建中，为政有皋虁。\n匈奴畏王商，吐蕃尊子仪。\n夷狄已破胆，将命公所宜。\n公拜手稽首，受命白玉墀。\n曰臣敢辞难，此亦何等时。\n家人安足谋，妻子不必辞。\n愿奉天地灵，愿奉宗庙威。\n径持紫泥诏，直入黄龙城。\n单于定稽颡，侍子当来迎。\n仁君方恃信，狂生休请缨。\n胡公清德人所难，谋同德协心志安。\n脱衣已被汉恩暖，离歌不道易水寒。\n皇天久阴后土湿，雨势未回风势急。\n车声辚辚马萧萧，壮士懦夫俱感泣。\n闾阎嫠妇亦何知，沥血投书干记室。\n夷虏从来性虎狼，不虞预备庸何伤。\n衷甲昔时闻楚幕，乘城前日记平凉。\n葵丘践土非荒城，勿轻谈士弃儒后。\n露布词成马犹倚，崤函关出鸡未鸣。\n巧匠何曾弃樗栎，刍荛之言或有益。\n不乞隋珠与和璧，吸乞乡关新信息。\n灵光虽在应萧萧，草中翁仲今何若。\n遗氓岂尚种桑麻，残虏如闻保城郭。\n嫠家父祖生齐鲁，位下名高人比数。\n当时稷下纵谈时，犹记人挥汗成雨。\n子孙南渡今几年，飘零遂与流人伍。\n欲将血汗寄山河，去洒东山一抔土。","playing":false,"sound_duration":269880,"name":"上枢密韩肖胄诗二首·其一"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0beed320d19cdcdbfac62129054ed7_46733.mp3","author":"李清照","author_id":0,"dynasty":"宋代","id":"52802","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a09b7c4beade1b391aa928949b8af46_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"红藕香残玉簟秋。轻解罗裳，独上兰舟。云中谁寄锦书来？雁字回时，月满西楼。\n花自飘零水自流。一种相思，两处闲愁。此情无计可消除，才下眉头，却上心头。","playing":false,"sound_duration":46733,"name":"一剪梅·红藕香残玉簟秋","video_id":"29"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a04594776f4590a9511be5c091c0952_23520.mp3","author":"王维","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"5780","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0874a3cb5e1eab9a056ae3a7399e51_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"独在异乡为异客，每逢佳节倍思亲。\n遥知兄弟登高处，遍插茱萸少一人。","playing":false,"sound_duration":23520,"name":"九月九日忆山东兄弟"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037ae4107f93820564f0e9ad321a18_21024.mp3","author":"白居易","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"2077","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03867b52414a47132794f76b2635fe_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"江南好，风景旧曾谙。日出江花红胜火，春来江水绿如蓝。能不忆江南？","playing":false,"sound_duration":21024,"name":"忆江南"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a045946d032118427f5c52506918eb9_29640.mp3","author":"韩非","author_id":0,"dynasty":"先秦","id":"1013635","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0874a2e482078c0246cdda3f5d8e9d_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"宋人有耕者。田中有株。兔走触株，折颈而死。因释其耒而守株，冀复得兔。兔不可复得，而身为宋国笑。","playing":false,"sound_duration":29640,"name":"守株待兔"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0fda0229e618e839226504b9babcf5_22488.mp3","author":"苏轼","author_id":0,"dynasty":"宋代","id":"1013634","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"竹外桃花三两枝，春江水暖鸭先知。\n蒌蒿满地芦芽短，正是河豚欲上时。","playing":false,"sound_duration":22488,"name":"惠崇春江晚景"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037ae59ee30f78e6890e8ede5adba8_22296.mp3","author":"杜牧","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"71248","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03867c3e7f665639caebb4b6d82a33_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"清明时节雨纷纷，路上行人欲断魂。\n借问酒家何处有？牧童遥指杏花村。","playing":false,"sound_duration":22296,"name":"清明"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a062e3c3db3bd803d782a1bdbeec22e_17580.mp3","author":"曾几","author_id":0,"dynasty":"宋代","id":"69119","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"梅子黄时日日晴，小溪泛尽却山行。\n绿阴不减来时路，添得黄鹂四五声。","playing":false,"sound_duration":17580,"name":"三衢道中"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037ae4bd4e7e51d25a8585ac93cebd_20232.mp3","author":"王安石","author_id":0,"dynasty":"宋代","id":"69086","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03867bddad839dc5ddfe525df79e2d_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"爆竹声中一岁除，春风送暖入屠苏。\n千门万户曈曈日，总把新桃换旧符。","playing":false,"sound_duration":20232,"name":"元日","video_id":"20"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0459480505dfb4b3e508005e0d5181_21552.mp3","author":"白居易","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"22098","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0874a461b9f1061cd67d77e9b1d528_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"人间四月芳菲尽，山寺桃花始盛开。\n长恨春归无觅处，不知转入此中来。","playing":false,"sound_duration":21552,"name":"大林寺桃花"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a055687aa1104c2ceb6eba74fa5597f_18416.mp3","author":"韦应物","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"9098","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"独怜幽草涧边生，上有黄鹂深树鸣。\n春潮带雨晚来急，野渡无人舟自横。","playing":false,"sound_duration":18416,"name":"滁州西涧"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a05c7949364fee5becbe8eafe53af74_43807.mp3","author":"佚名","author_id":0,"dynasty":"先秦","id":"1","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a05c79473daae177bf01459a77318f5_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"关关雎鸠，在河之洲。窈窕淑女，君子好逑。\n参差荇菜，左右流之。窈窕淑女，寤寐求之。\n求之不得，寤寐思服。悠哉悠哉，辗转反侧。\n参差荇菜，左右采之。窈窕淑女，琴瑟友之。\n参差荇菜，左右芼之。窈窕淑女，钟鼓乐之。","playing":false,"sound_duration":43807,"name":"关雎"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0a0f03dd7b68fa6adb6f05975e1ef4_86087.mp3","author":"佚名","author_id":0,"dynasty":"南北朝","id":"48064","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"忆梅下西洲，折梅寄江北。\n单衫杏子红，双鬓鸦雏色。\n西洲在何处？两桨桥头渡。\n日暮伯劳飞，风吹乌臼树。\n树下即门前，门中露翠钿。\n开门郎不至，出门采红莲。\n采莲南塘秋，莲花过人头。\n低头弄莲子，莲子清如水。\n置莲怀袖中，莲心彻底红。\n忆郎郎不至，仰首望飞鸿。\n鸿飞满西洲，望郎上青楼。\n楼高望不见，尽日栏杆头。\n栏杆十二曲，垂手明如玉。\n卷帘天自高，海水摇空绿。\n海水梦悠悠，君愁我亦愁。\n南风知我意，吹梦到西洲。","playing":false,"sound_duration":86087,"name":"西洲曲"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a088d6d2ed7beb9af9f0500de77ed94_26096.mp3","author":"杜甫","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"10832","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"今夜鄜州月，闺中只独看。\n遥怜小儿女，未解忆长安。\n香雾云鬟湿，清辉玉臂寒。\n何时倚虚幌，双照泪痕干。","playing":false,"sound_duration":26096,"name":"月夜"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0a5c288b3636f164f11d480f1d1973_170527.MP3","author":"张若虚","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"5256","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a09ad472059234761968e2a756e22e5_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"春江潮水连海平，海上明月共潮生。\n滟滟随波千万里，何处春江无月明！\n江流宛转绕芳甸，月照花林皆似霰。\n空里流霜不觉飞，汀上白沙看不见。\n江天一色无纤尘，皎皎空中孤月轮。\n江畔何人初见月？江月何年初照人？\n人生代代无穷已，江月年年望相似。(望相似一作：只相似)\n不知江月待何人，但见长江送流水。\n白云一片去悠悠，青枫浦上不胜愁。\n谁家今夜扁舟子？何处相思明月楼？\n可怜楼上月裴回，应照离人妆镜台。(裴回一作：徘徊)\n玉户帘中卷不去，捣衣砧上拂还来。\n此时相望不相闻，愿逐月华流照君。\n鸿雁长飞光不度，鱼龙潜跃水成文。\n昨夜闲潭梦落花，可怜春半不还家。\n江水流春去欲尽，江潭落月复西斜。\n斜月沉沉藏海雾，碣石潇湘无限路。\n不知乘月几人归，落月摇情满江树。(落月一作：落花)","playing":false,"sound_duration":170527,"name":"春江花月夜","video_id":"8"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a108f29451e8c57ac8d6a8132f944bb_38243.mp3","author":"柳永","author_id":0,"dynasty":"宋代","id":"48269","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"伫倚危楼风细细，望极春愁，黯黯生天际。草色烟光残照里，无言谁会凭阑意。\n拟把疏狂图一醉，对酒当歌，强乐还无味。衣带渐宽终不悔，为伊消得人憔悴。","playing":false,"sound_duration":38243,"name":"蝶恋花·伫倚危楼风细细"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0a5d333485c8248c7bdc96b8c470b1_37776.mp3","author":"佚名","author_id":0,"dynasty":"先秦","id":"3","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"采采卷耳，不盈顷筐。嗟我怀人，寘彼周行。(寘通：置)\n陟彼崔嵬，我马虺隤。我姑酌彼金罍，维以不永怀。\n陟彼高冈，我马玄黄。我姑酌彼兕觥，维以不永伤。\n陟彼砠矣，我马瘏矣。我仆痡矣，云何吁矣。","playing":false,"sound_duration":37776,"name":"卷耳"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0892ebb1702bb2e88f6ba442e9630a_18546.mp3","author":"杜牧","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"27724","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"青山隐隐水迢迢，秋尽江南草未凋。\n二十四桥明月夜，玉人何处教吹箫？","playing":false,"sound_duration":18546,"name":"寄扬州韩绰判官"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0807b31338d1d2d6c57a7e7c6ff664_15908.mp3","author":"王维","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"5773","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"红豆生南国，春来发几枝。\n愿君多采撷，此物最相思。","playing":false,"sound_duration":15908,"name":"相思"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a098a6e6e12e480ef46f565c9b02dfa_30912.mp3","author":"李清照","author_id":0,"dynasty":"宋代","id":"52809","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a09b8198ceff66de8c5fb65cbca5cfa_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"薄雾浓云愁永昼，瑞脑销金兽。佳节又重阳，玉枕纱厨，半夜凉初透。(厨通：橱；销金兽一作：消金兽)\n东篱把酒黄昏后，有暗香盈袖。莫道不销魂，帘卷西风，人比黄花瘦。(人比一作：人似)","playing":false,"sound_duration":30912,"name":"醉花阴·薄雾浓云愁永昼"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0a8c3ae7c805366e0ba7e476d3ea48_62256.mp3","author":"李白","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"8488","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"秋风清，秋月明，\n落叶聚还散，寒鸦栖复惊。\n相思相见知何日？此时此夜难为情！\n入我相思门，知我相思苦，\n长相思兮长相忆，短相思兮无穷极，\n早知如此绊人心，何如当初莫相识。(后三句存疑)","playing":false,"sound_duration":62256,"name":"三五七言 / 秋风词"},{"sound":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03a514ad222da72328f9d562fcbc06_54384.mp3","author":"苏轼","author_id":0,"dynasty":"宋代","id":"49480","sound_pic":"http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03a5375b6217de2a9f52267651490a_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"十年生死两茫茫，不思量，自难忘。千里孤坟，无处话凄凉。纵使相逢应不识，尘满面，鬓如霜。\n夜来幽梦忽还乡，小轩窗，正梳妆。相顾无言，惟有泪千行。料得年年肠断处，明月夜，短松冈。","playing":false,"sound_duration":54384,"name":"江城子·乙卯正月二十日夜记梦","video_id":"24"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a15d3e41d68a56d68afa725f9c40025_46152.mp3","author":"李商隐","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"28698","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07aa4e8d2a0e05b4b4152644d50623_909_1154.jpg","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"相见时难别亦难，东风无力百花残。\n春蚕到死丝方尽，蜡炬成灰泪始干。\n晓镜但愁云鬓改，夜吟应觉月光寒。\n蓬山此去无多路，青鸟殷勤为探看。","playing":false,"sound_duration":46152,"name":"无题·相见时难别亦难"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a09aed04dba8fc02f48c6826209a34e_27312.mp3","author":"李清照","author_id":0,"dynasty":"宋代","id":"52817","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a09aecfde36474ff30f08b3e10c8417_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"风住尘香花已尽，日晚倦梳头。\n物是人非事事休，欲语泪先流。\n闻说双溪春尚好，也拟泛轻舟。\n只恐双溪舴艋舟，载不动许多愁。","playing":false,"sound_duration":27312,"name":"武陵春·春晚"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0bef0d2ca94575d9daa580f7ef7cc9_66481.mp3","author":"李清照","author_id":0,"dynasty":"宋代","id":"52821","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c67522eacf715bb088267d1a47d_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"寻寻觅觅，冷冷清清，凄凄惨惨戚戚。乍暖还寒时候，最难将息。三杯两盏淡酒，怎敌他、晚来风急！雁过也，正伤心，却是旧时相识。\n满地黄花堆积，憔悴损，如今有谁堪摘？守着窗儿，独自怎生得黑！梧桐更兼细雨，到黄昏、点点滴滴。这次第，怎一个愁字了得！","playing":false,"sound_duration":66481,"name":"声声慢·寻寻觅觅"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a1439036fa07957f7829aef95ec445c_75912.mp3","author":"佚名","author_id":0,"dynasty":"先秦","id":"56","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"硕人其颀，衣锦褧衣。齐侯之子，卫侯之妻。东宫之妹，邢侯之姨，谭公维私。\n手如柔荑，肤如凝脂。领如蝤蛴，齿如瓠犀。螓首蛾眉，巧笑倩兮，美目盼兮。\n硕人敖敖，说于农郊。四牡有骄，朱幩镳镳。翟茀以朝。大夫夙退，无使君劳。\n河水洋洋，北流活活。施罛濊濊，鳣鲔发发。葭菼揭揭，庶姜孽孽，庶士有朅。","playing":false,"sound_duration":75912,"name":"硕人"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a09936908ae0863aa68435d8ea9dc26_41299.mp3","author":"苏轼","author_id":0,"dynasty":"宋代","id":"49573","sound_pic":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a09ad464577eda95e7b6b3f40393f17_909_1154.png","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"游蕲水清泉寺，寺临兰溪，溪水西流。\n山下兰芽短浸溪，松间沙路净无泥，萧萧暮雨子规啼。(萧萧一作：潇潇)\n谁道人生无再少？门前流水尚能西！休将白发唱黄鸡。","playing":false,"sound_duration":41299,"name":"浣溪沙·游蕲水清泉寺"},{"sound":"https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a06dd2b672fec0df9ddaae47b14bc3b_13923.mp3","author":"王维","author_id":0,"dynasty":"唐代","id":"5737","isCollect":false,"pure_content":"空山不见人，但闻人语响。\n返景入深林，复照青苔上。","playing":false,"sound_duration":13923,"name":"鹿柴"}]